す。英語には「手段」（～で）を表す表現として前置詞を使うのですが、これが実は使い分けが必要だったりして、英語学習者が苦手に思う箇所らしいのです。日本語でし","image_url":"https://www.makocho0828.net/wp-content/uploads/hatena/20171005155921.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1507186869,"service_name":"まこちょ英語ブログ","service_icon":"https://www.makocho0828.net/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/profile.png","from_url":"https://www.makocho0828.net/entry/by-with-171005","original_url":"https://www.makocho0828.net/entry/by-with-171005"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gUWq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bc922ed-9e53-4eee-ba4b-ff8be21d6de7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"条件を表す前置詞ってなんだろ","ts":"1614860636.445000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g9XCw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8e08131-8da1-4012-892c-081f53cd9edf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 条件を表す前置詞「with」の後に新プラン２つの内容を具体的に説明しています。","ts":"1614860565.444700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"myfH0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"427cea19-219b-4796-8a09-73bdcb506d06","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"withの部分の解説がよくわからんかった","ts":"1614860564.444500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AbC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76d4abd7-08f0-496c-b91d-3f32b0c419c0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ読んでいるけど","ts":"1614860552.444100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"upy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"067baff8-bbed-47ec-831d-0a4a38b504fc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://www.eigonews.net/rakuten-ratchets-up-mobile-price-war/\u003e","ts":"1614860548.443900","attachments":[{"fallback":"国際英語バイリンガル道場【やさしい英語ニュース】: 楽天が携帯の価格競争に拍車【Rakuten ratchets up mobile price war】 | 国際英語バイリンガル道場【やさしい英語ニュース】","id":1,"title":"楽天が携帯の価格競争に拍車【Rakuten ratchets up mobile price war】 | 国際英語バイリンガル道場【やさしい英語ニュース】","title_link":"https://www.eigonews.net/rakuten-ratchets-up-mobile-price-war/","text":"Rakuten Mobile announced new prices on Thursday, with free data for light users and unlimited data at 2980 yen a month. The company has ratcheted up the price war among mobile phone carriers.","image_url":"https://www.eigonews.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/phone-802125_1920-1024x681.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"国際英語バイリンガル道場【やさしい英語ニュース】","service_icon":"https://www.eigonews.net/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/cropped-medium02-180x180.jpg","from_url":"https://www.eigonews.net/rakuten-ratchets-up-mobile-price-war/","original_url":"https://www.eigonews.net/rakuten-ratchets-up-mobile-price-war/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SLD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e77cf20d-36a0-49b4-a1e6-97a39725b2ad","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分も好きでした","ts":"1614851193.442900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xj1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e93789b6-a498-4598-9231-13dc16f3dfdf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"この人の動画は結構好きでよく見ていた","ts":"1614849574.442700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6cfd72c-ad18-4f10-b25a-d1a450420692","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"帰るだけで叩かれるの大変だなって思って見ていた","ts":"1614849525.442400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YzAE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b22a011a-84fe-4aaa-a18c-cbfc6f68b081","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まぁ変えること自体は別に全然いいし、反対もしてないですが事後対応が少し間違えたかなって感じですね","ts":"1614847284.442000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NJkhm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3013649c-7260-4b72-8536-dd217